undertone builds on the work of others:

- The method for emotion vectors, and the list of 171 emotion words in
  stories/prompts/emotions.json, come from Anthropic's emotion concepts work:
  https://transformer-circuits.pub/2026/emotions/index.html

- The stories and dialogues in stories/corpus were written by three language models,
  named in stories/README.md. No person wrote or edited them.

- The Jacobian lens files are not part of this repository. They are published by
  Neuronpedia (https://huggingface.co/neuronpedia/jacobian-lens) and fetched at the
  revision the model's contract pins. The J++ lens was fitted by a contributor
  (https://huggingface.co/bubskee/qwen3.5-4b-r-jpp-lenses).

- The model, Qwen/Qwen3.5-4B, is not part of this repository. Its files are fetched
  from https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.5-4B at the revision the contract pins.

- The emotion vectors in core/tools/emotion/sets and the lens baseline in
  core/tools/jlens/baselines were computed by this software from the corpus, with
  that model and, for the baseline, the J++ lens.

The model and the lens files come under their own licenses.
